  "note": "Usability evidence for the published guide. Every check runs against the tracked static documents served locally, so it reproduces from a checkout with no network and no deploy. Accessibility, keyboard, reflow and link checks cover the guide documents; the front page and the search document keep their existing owners and are exercised here only as the journey's endpoints. Screenshots stay under the ignored .artifacts/ path and only their sha256 is recorded, per docs/capture-manifest-guard.md.",
